                                        "reachable-minimum, VAMP-sibling, "
                                        "incidence self-check, seed-gradient, vpsum, "
                                        "usable-recipient, co-location and seed unmet-band blocks "
                                        "did not run. They are READ-ONLY, so the seed and the "
